  The reel_script says the Friday opening event was followed by the special prayer starting Thursday night; the article says the special prayer ran from Thursday night to Friday morning, so the reel_script wording 'வெள்ளிக்கிழமை நடைபெற்ற திறப்பு நிகழ்ச்சியில் வியாழக்கிழமை இரவு முதல்' is inconsistent with the source timing, not a clear error but a sequencing/timing distortion.
  The reel_script states the Hindu-Muslim unity purpose and the Sri Sengottaiyan title as 'வருவாய் பேரிடர் மேலாண்மைத் துறை அமைச்சர்' which matches the article, but the reel_script omits that the special prayer was held under the mosque president's leadership in a way that conflicts with the article's statement that the prayer was held from Thursday night to Friday morning, and it omits the detail that the Ayipalayam residents performed worship at the Mariamman temple specifically (only partially mentioned).
  The caption and slides_spec say the 'Hindu and Muslim unity' was shown, but the reel_script and caption omit that the sirvarisai was carried by 'ஊர்பொதுமக்கள்' from Kurumanthur as a whole in the caption, while the caption adds 'ஆயிபாளையம் ஊர்பொதுமக்கள்' as if they performed the Mariamman worship together with the Poongulali worship, which blurs two different groups' actions.
